    "record_id": "span:opus5-2608.14798v1/chebyshev",
    "record_type": "agtxiv.v3.source-span/0.0.0",
    "revision": 1
   },
   {
    "content_hash": "sha256:69561d158fad45a479f0650861047d456f88910b4dae3aeda48e7c14939cab64",
    "record_id": "span:opus5-2608.14798v1/subadd-supporting",
    "record_type": "agtxiv.v3.source-span/0.0.0",
    "revision": 1
   }
  ],
  "statement": "Lemma (cSPF supermultiplicativity): for any bipartite separable pure state, $\\mathcal{Z}^c_\\beta(\\psi_A\\otimes\\phi_B)\\geq\\frac{\\mathcal{Z}^c_\\beta(\\psi_A)\\mathcal{Z}^c_\\beta(\\phi_B)}{e^{-\\beta}(\\cosh\\beta-1)}$. The proof reduces to a reweighting inequality proved as a Chebyshev-type monotone reweighting lemma in the supplement.",
  "system": "bipartite separable pure states"
 },
